WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.932
"I need a grand plan," Jack thought.

2
00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:14.474
All at once one came to him.

3
00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:25.192
Before he reached the beanstalk, he made a sharp turn.

4
00:00:25.193 --> 00:00:27.779
Jack dashed across a field.

5
00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:32.219
The ogre's footsteps pounded behind him.

6
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:36.324
Jack leaped over bushes.

7
00:00:36.325 --> 00:00:38.925
He ran as fast as he could.

8
00:00:38.926 --> 00:00:46.670
The ogre was huffing and puffing.

9
00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:50.154
"He's slowing down!" Jack thought.

10
00:00:50.155 --> 00:00:52.875
He ran toward the beanstalk.

11
00:00:52.876 --> 00:00:57.848
Clutching the harp, he leaped onto the beanstalk.

12
00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:00.921
Quickly Jack started going down.

13
00:01:00.922 --> 00:01:05.362
He heard the ogre panting above him.

14
00:01:05.363 --> 00:01:10.206
The ogre was getting closer to the beanstalk.

15
00:01:10.207 --> 00:01:15.151
Suddenly the golden harp let out a sharp cry.

16
00:01:15.152 --> 00:01:20.464
"Master! Master!"

17
00:01:20.465 --> 00:01:24.241
The ogre looked down with his nasty eyes.

18
00:01:24.242 --> 00:01:26.815
He spotted Jack!

19
00:01:26.816 --> 00:01:29.840
"Aha!" the ogre cried.

20
00:01:29.841 --> 00:01:33.470
"There you are!"

21
00:01:33.471 --> 00:01:38.253
The ogre threw himself onto the beanstalk.

22
00:01:38.254 --> 00:01:42.044
The beanstalk bent from the heavy giant's weight.

23
00:01:42.045 --> 00:01:46.029
"Whoa!" Jack gripped it tightly.

24
00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:52.426
The ogre gave a loud roar.

25
00:01:52.427 --> 00:01:55.159
Jack moved as fast as he could.

26
00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.363
But so did the ogre!

27
00:01:57.364 --> 00:02:02.612
The beanstalk swayed back and forth.

28
00:02:02.613 --> 00:02:07.092
Jack raced down through the clouds.

29
00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:11.561
He went down, down, down.

30
00:02:11.562 --> 00:02:20.030
Soon he was far below the ogre.

31
00:02:20.031 --> 00:02:23.394
At last Jack's feet touched the ground.

32
00:02:23.395 --> 00:02:26.927
"Mother!" he yelled.

33
00:02:26.928 --> 00:02:31.867
"Come quickly. And bring an ax!"

